flowchart TD
    UI[React + TypeScript workspace] --> API[FastAPI: authentication, role and project access]
    API --> Intake[Private PDF / CSV / JSON intake]
    Intake --> Parser[Bounded PDF worker and deterministic parsers]
    Parser --> Review[Field provenance and human review]
    Review --> Confirm[Authorized procurement confirmation]
    API --> Workflow[Persisted Python state machine]
    Workflow --> Match[BOQ + PO + accepted receipt + invoice reconciliation]
    Match --> Risk[Rules-based blocking findings]
    Risk --> Cash[30-day base / delayed / cost scenarios]
    Cash --> Prepare[Exact proposal + cash and receipt reservations]
    Prepare --> Human[Different authorized human approves]
    Human --> Execute[Authenticated idempotent sandbox executor]
    Execute --> Atomic[Atomic cash, payment, subledger, receipt and audit commit]
    Workflow -. optional explanation only .-> Ollama[Ollama / deterministic fallback]
    Confirm --> DB[(SQLite: exact money, foreign keys and uniqueness)]
    Match --> DB
    Prepare --> DB
    Atomic --> DB
    Atomic --> Audit[Canonical SHA-256 audit chain]
    Audit --> Verify[Integrity verifier and exported evidence]
    API --> Price[Material catalogue and persisted price searches]
    Price --> Providers[Optional SerpApi / DataForSEO + verified quotes / references]
    Providers --> Evidence[Immutable source observations and selections]
    API --> QS[Profile-aware geometry and checked takeoff sheets]
    QS --> Estimate[Versioned estimating BOQ and component rate analysis]
    Evidence --> Estimate
    Estimate --> Budget[Independent check and Admin baseline approval]
    Estimate --> Overlay[Scheduled uncommitted forecast overlay]
    Budget --> DB
    Overlay -. does not authorize payment .-> Cash
    Estimate --> DB
